---
classes:
  - quire-page
  - quire-acknowledgements
layout: base.11ty.js
description: Acknowledgements page built from publication.yaml contributors
---

{% comment %}
`credits` (front matter): a list of roles, each naming the people who held it
by their `id` in publication.yaml, e.g.
  credits:
    - role: Curator
      contributors: [ethornberry]
Names and job titles are looked up from publication.yaml, so they are only
ever edited there. A person's title is shown only the first time they appear.
The page's own text renders below the credits. Styles: custom.css.
{% endcomment %}

{% pageHeader
  byline_format=byline_format,
  image=image,
  label=label,
  pageContributors=pageContributors,
  subtitle=subtitle,
  title=title,
  page_pdf_output=page_pdf_output,
  key=key,
  outputs=outputs
%}
<section class="section quire-page__content">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      {% if credits %}
      {%- assign seen = "," -%}
      <dl class="acknowledgements-credits">
        {% for credit in credits %}
        <div class="acknowledgements-credits__item">
          <dt>{{ credit.role }}</dt>
          <dd>
            <ul class="acknowledgements-credits__people">
              {% for id in credit.contributors %}
              {%- assign person = publication.contributor | where: "id", id | first -%}
              {%- assign key = "," | append: id | append: "," -%}
              <li>
                <span class="acknowledgements-credits__name">{{ person | fullname }}</span>
                {%- unless seen contains key %}{% if person.title %}<span class="acknowledgements-credits__title">{{ person.title }}</span>{% endif %}{% endunless %}
              </li>
              {%- assign seen = seen | append: id | append: "," -%}
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </dd>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </dl>
      {% endif %}

      {% if content %}
      <div class="acknowledgements-text">
        {{ content }}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section quire-page__content">
  <div class="container">
    {% pageButtons pagination=pagination %}
  </div>
</section>
